WEBVTT

NOTE English captions aligned to the synchronised continuous introduction with opening and closing titles.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:07.050
Hi everyone. My name is Ayomide Ajibola.

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.790
I am an executive assistant.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:13.140
I help CEOs, executives and founders stay

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:17.420
organized. Reclaim their time and keep their operations

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.330
running smoothly through proactive administrative support.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:22.580
Project coordination.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:26.200
As an executive assistant, I provide support in areas

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.170
such as email management and inbox management.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:33.970
Calendar and appointment scheduling. Documentation and report writing.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:38.360
Meeting agendas. Presentation. Data entry and PDF

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:41.030
formatting. Proofreading and editing.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:45.850
Travel planning and itinerary. Research and article writing.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:50.750
Project coordination. AI automation and general administrative tasks.

00:00:51.554 --> 00:00:56.294
Some of the tools I work with include Google Workspace, Microsoft 365,

00:00:56.294 --> 00:01:00.554
Trello, Asana, Zapier, Fathom and

00:01:01.477 --> 00:01:02.387
other productivity and AI-powered tools.

00:01:02.387 --> 00:01:04.877
Why should you consider working with me?

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:09.107
For me, being an executive assistant goes beyond just simply completing

00:01:09.107 --> 00:01:13.697
tasks. I believe in taking ownership, being proactive,

00:01:14.387 --> 00:01:18.027
paying attention to details, communicating effectively because I know the

00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:22.517
power of communication and handling confidential information with discretion.

00:01:23.027 --> 00:01:25.207
My goal is not just to get things done.

00:01:25.207 --> 00:01:26.957
My goal is not just to complete a task.

00:01:27.327 --> 00:01:31.667
But to bring structure, organization and an effective system into the

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:32.537
way you work. Allowing you to focus on what matters most.

00:01:32.537 --> 00:01:33.327
Thank you very much.
